eptember, Nalini Malani will inhabit the Whitechapel Gallery with ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.nationalgallery.org.uk/about-us/press-and-media/press-releases/artist-nalini-malani-receives-the-first-national-gallery-contemporary-fellowship-with-art-fund\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d109\"},\"ref\":\"d109\",\"snippet\":\" ... QWF Literary Database of Quebec English-Language Authors. Retrieved 14 January 2015.British Council, Yann Martel Biography. British Council, Literature. Retrieved 1 April 2016. and the 2002 Asian/Pacific American Award for Literature.2001–2003 Asian Pacific American Awards for Literature. Cooperative Children's Book Centre, School of ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yann_Martel\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d116\"},\"ref\":\"d116\",\"snippet\":\" ... Esports Asian Games, 2022 Hangzhou League of Legends\\ntitlestyle: background:#DDDDDD, font-weight:bold\\nexpand: yes\\n\\nJung Ji-hoon (; born March 3, 2001), better known as Chovy, is a South Korean professional League of Legends player for Gen.G. Domestically, he has won four League of Legends Champions ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chovy_(gamer)\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"801cc66a37ad380b20c773a70c126d08d8ece6e10515064ae960cecfbb98990e\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"e6d391eff21f42292a2d25e3c8bafc8bc410cef347e5aaddbd60b8e457154039\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Man Asian Literary Prize 2016 winning book author born Gwangju\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_fec1b5e744cf4806962876a0"},{"content":n