.. \",\"title\":\"https://griffinpoetryprize.com/judges/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d118\"},\"ref\":\"d118\",\"snippet\":\" ... Mara Polgovsky Ezcurra has been shortlisted for the 2020 Association for the Study of the Arts of the Present (ASAP) Book Prize is winner of the 2019 Art Journal prize from the College Art Association.\\n\\nBeyond the City and the Bridge: East Asian Immigration in a New Jersey ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.rutgersuniversitypress.org/awards/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d20\"},\"ref\":\"d20\",\"snippet\":\" ... Lambda Literary Award-winning debut memoir, Man Alive (City Lights, 2014) was named one of the best books of the year by NPR Books, BuzzFeed, Kirkus, and Publisher's Weekly. His follow-up, Amateur (Scribner, 2018), was shortlisted for the U.K.'s Baillie-Gifford Book Prize for ... \",\"title\":\"https://pen.org/meet-the-2021-literary-awards-judges/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d54\"},\"ref\":\"d54\",\"snippet\":\" ... She is a winner of a 2014 Lambda Literary Award, a 2016 Lambda Literary Award, the 2016 Jessie Redmon Fauset Book Award in Fiction, the 2016 Inaugural Betty Berzon Emerging Writer Award from the Publishing Triangle, and a 2014 O. Henry Prize. Her debut short story collection, Happiness ... \",\"title\":\"https://artsandsciences.syracuse.edu/english-department/creative-writing-mf-program/raymond-carver-reading-series/previous-raymond-carver-reading-series/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"a7d9ac21b8c71821472a182